It took me a while to figure it out, and I am still not sure this is correct.
But, anyway, if you are wielding a long sword, artifact or not, Hand of 
Elbereth will make the sword blessed rustproof Excalibur. You'll also get some
intrinsics (fire resistance, cold resistance, poison resistance, see 
invisible).

If you are a chaotic character, you will get Hand of Arioch (?) instead. For
that you receive a blessed rustproof Stormbringer (you don't have to wield
a broadsword). One day I was playing a chaotic character, I got the Hand of
Arioch. Only a blessed normal broadsword appeared since I already have 
Stormbringer. I was hoping it would rusfproof my Stormbringer. So this 
won't do you much good if you already got Stormy.

